  "fact": "features contains every module featureSwitch name with its store value (false when unknown). fieldToggles names come from the live module and values from the 2026-10-19 registry (unknown names are false); TweetDetail enables withArticleRichContentState, withArticleSummaryText and withArticleVoiceOver. A features_missing response adds the named switches and retries once.",
